{"type":"message","id":"cbcddd9b","parentId":"b6af0a17","timestamp":"2026-02-18T12:59:17.699Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The workspace appears to be essentially empty. I need to create the OSINT toolkit from scratch. Let me plan out what I need to build:\n\n1. **Node.js Dependencies**: I'll need to create a package.json file with all the required packages\n2. **OpenClaw Skills**: I need to create skill definitions for:\n   - osint-crawl\n   - osint-analyze\n   - osint-youtube\n   - osint-search-multi\n3. **Documentation**: TOOLS-OSINT.md\n4. **Implementation**: JavaScript/Node.js modules for each skill\n\nFirst, let me check how OpenClaw skills are structured by looking at any existing examples or documentation. Since there's nothing in the workspace, I'll need to infer the structure from the OpenClaw ecosystem knowledge.\n\nOpenClaw skills typically have:\n- SKILL.md (documentation)\n- skill.js or index.js (implementation)\n- package.json (dependencies)\n- Configuration in some central registry\n\nLet me start by creating the package.json with all the required packages.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"Now I'll create the comprehensive OSINT toolkit for OpenClaw. Let me start by establishing the Node.js dependencies and then build each skill systematically."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_5fac1befc68d4e839a3d169c","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"{\n  \"name\": \"openclaw-osint-toolkit\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"description\": \"Comprehensive OSINT toolkit for OpenClaw with web crawling, data analysis, YouTube analysis, and multi-engine search\",\n  \"main\": \"index.js\",\n  \"type\": \"module\",\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"test\": \"echo \\\"Error: no test specified\\\" && exit 1\"\n  },\n  \"keywords\": [\n    \"openclaw\",\n    \"osint\",\n    \"web-crawling\",\n    \"youtube\",\n    \"data-analysis\",\n    \"search\"\n  ],\n  \"author\": \"OpenClaw OSINT Team\",\n  \"license\": \"MIT\",\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"puppeteer\": \"^23.0.0\",\n    \"cheerio\": \"^1.0.0-rc.12\",\n    \"axios\": \"^1.6.0\",\n    \"csv-parser\": \"^3.0.0\",\n    \"fast-csv\": \"^4.3.6\",\n    \"json2csv\": \"^6.0.0-alpha.2\",\n    \"simple-statistics\": \"^7.8.3\",\n    \"ytdl-core\": \"^4.11.5\",\n    \"youtube-dl-exec\": \"^2.4.2\",\n    \"node-fetch\": \"^3.3.2\",\n    \"p-limit\": \"^3.1.0\",\n    \"robots-parser\": \"^3.0.0\",\n    \"user-agents\": \"^1.0.1349\"\n  },\n  \"engines\": {\n    \"node\": \">=18.0.0\"\n  }\n}","file_path":"D:\\workspace\\appDev\\openclaw\\workspace-osint\\package.json"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"stepfun/step-3.5-flash:free","usage":{"input":13133,"output":914,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":14047,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771419548579}}
