{"type":"message","id":"b13a806a","parentId":"03d275b9","timestamp":"2026-02-18T12:59:27.979Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me create the first skill: osint-crawl. This will be a recursive web crawler with depth limits and polite delays.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_a5aa0d4c5bef4867a7d7351d","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"# osint-crawl - Recursive Web Crawler\n\n## Description\nPerform controlled, recursive web crawling with depth limits, polite delays, and robots.txt compliance. Supports both headless Puppeteer (for JavaScript-heavy sites) and Cheerio (for static sites).\n\n## Usage\n```\nosint-crawl <url> [options]\n```\n\n## Parameters\n- `url` (required): Starting URL to crawl\n- `--depth, -d` (optional): Maximum recursion depth (default: 2)\n- `--delay, -D` (optional): Delay between requests in milliseconds (default: 1000)\n- `--max-pages, -m` (optional): Maximum pages to crawl (default: 50)\n- `--output, -o` (optional): Output file path (CSV/JSON)\n- `--format, -f` (optional): Output format: 'csv' or 'json' (default: 'json')\n- `--respect-robots, -r` (optional): Respect robots.txt (default: true)\n- `--user-agent, -u` (optional): Custom user agent string\n- `--timeout, -t` (optional): Request timeout in ms (default: 30000)\n- `--include-external, -e` (optional): Include external links (default: false)\n- `--headless` (optional): Use Puppeteer headless browser (default: false)\n\n## Examples\n\n**Basic crawl with depth 2:**\n```\nosint-crawl https://example.com --depth 2\n```\n\n**Aggressive crawl of small site:**\n```\nosint-crawl https://target.com --depth 3 --max-pages 100 --delay 500 --headless\n```\n\n**Stealth crawl with custom user agent:**\n```\nosint-crawl https://site.com --depth 1 --user-agent \"Mozilla/5.0 (compatible; OSINT-Scanner/1.0)\"\n```\n\n**Export to CSV:**\n```\nosint-crawl https://example.com --depth 2 --output results.csv --format csv\n```\n\n## Output\nReturns a structured dataset containing:\n- `url`: Page URL\n- `title`: Page title\n- `statusCode`: HTTP status\n- `linksFound`: Number of links discovered\n- `contentLength`: Size in bytes\n- `crawledAt`: Timestamp\n- `links`: Array of discovered links (if --extract-links enabled)\n\n## Capabilities\n- ✅ Robots.txt compliance\n- ✅ Rate limiting with configurable delays\n- ✅ Depth-limited recursion\n- ✅ Both static (Cheerio) and dynamic (Puppeteer) crawling\n- ✅ Concurrent request limiting via p-limit\n- ✅ Export to CSV/JSON\n- ✅ Link extraction and classification (internal/external)\n- ✅ Custom headers and user agents\n\n## Limitations\n- JavaScript-heavy sites require --headless (slower, resource-intensive)\n- Large sites may hit --max-pages limit\n- Some sites block automated crawlers despite polite delays\n- No session persistence or cookie management across runs\n- No built-in duplicate URL normalization (case, trailing slash)\n\n## Notes\n- Always respect rate limits and target server capacity\n- Use --respect-robots to honor crawl-delay directives\n- For aggressive crawling, increase delays to avoid IP bans\n- Puppeteer requires Chrome/Chromium binary (auto-downloaded on first run)","file_path":"D:\\workspace\\appDev\\openclaw\\workspace-osint\\skills\\osint-crawl\\SKILL.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"stepfun/step-3.5-flash:free","usage":{"input":13991,"output":839,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":14830,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771419560376}}
