{"type":"message","id":"2d30d691","parentId":"ad531948","timestamp":"2026-02-18T13:04:28.630Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Excellent! Now I have created a complete OSINT toolkit. Let me create one more quick reference guide for the user, and then provide my final summary to the main agent.\n\nLet me also verify that all files are in place by listing the directory tree mentally:\n- package.json ✅\n- index.js ✅\n- README.md ✅\n- TOOLS-OSINT.md ✅\n- IMPLEMENTATION-REPORT.md ✅\n- test-data-sample.csv ✅\n- test-data-employees.json ✅\n- skills/\n  - osint-crawl/\n    - osint-crawl.js ✅\n    - SKILL.md ✅\n  - osint-analyze/\n    - osint-analyze.js ✅\n    - SKILL.md ✅\n  - osint-youtube/\n    - osint-youtube.js ✅\n    - SKILL.md ✅\n  - osint-search-multi/\n    - osint-search-multi.js ✅\n    - SKILL.md ✅\n\nEverything is created! Let me now provide the final report to the main agent.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Let me create one final quick reference card:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_20a374033ff143e6887c128e","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"# OSINT Toolkit Quick Reference\n\n## Installation\n```bash\nnpm install\n# Optional: set Brave API key\nexport BRAVE_SEARCH_API_KEY=\"your-key\"\n```\n\n## Test Quickly\n```bash\n# Analyze sample data\nnode skills/osint-analyze/osint-analyze.js test-data-employees.json --columns salary,age\n\n# Lightweight crawl test\nnode skills/osint-crawl/osint-crawl.js https://example.com --depth 1 --max-pages 5\n\n# Test search\nnode skills/osint-search-multi/osint-search-multi.js \"cybersecurity\" --count 5\n```\n\n## Common Commands\n\n### Web Crawling\n```bash\nnode index.js osint-crawl <url> [options]\n  --depth N          # Recursion depth (default: 2)\n  --delay N          # Milliseconds between requests (default: 1000)\n  --max-pages N      # Stop after N pages (default: 50)\n  --headless         # Use Puppeteer for JS sites\n  --output FILE.json # Save results\n```\n\n### Data Analysis\n```bash\nnode index.js osint-analyze <file.csv|json> [options]\n  --columns col1,col2   # Analyze specific columns\n  --outliers iqr|zscore # Outlier detection method\n  --threshold N         # Outlier threshold (1.5 or 3)\n  --trends             # Linear regression analysis\n  --dates DATE_COL     # Time-series analysis\n  --groupby GROUP_COL  # Group analysis\n```\n\n### YouTube Extraction\n```bash\nnode index.js osint-youtube <video-id-or-url> [options]\n  --transcript         # Get captions/transcript\n  --comments           # Get comments\n  --max-comments N     # Limit comment count (default: 100)\n  --lang LANGUAGE      # Transcript language (default: en)\n  --cookies FILE       # For age-restricted videos\n  --proxy URL          # For geo-blocked content\n```\n\n### Multi-Engine Search\n```bash\nnode index.js osint-search-multi \"<query>\" [options]\n  --engines brave,google # Engines to query\n  --count N            # Results per engine (max 50)\n  --country US         # Localize by country\n  --language en        # Results language\n  --freshness pw       # Past week (pd=pw=pm=py)\n  --safeSearch         # Enable SafeSearch\n```\n\n## Important Notes\n\n⚠️ **Rate Limiting**: Always use `--delay` ≥ 2000ms for production crawling\n⚠️ **Robots.txt**: Default enabled - disable with `--respect-robots false` (use responsibly)\n⚠️ **Puppeteer**: Requires 100MB+ disk space for Chromium download\n⚠️ **YouTube**: Some content may require `--cookies` or `--proxy`\n⚠️ **Brave API**: Free tier ~50/day; get API key for production\n\n## File Locations\n\n```\nworkspace/\n├── package.json                    # Dependencies\n├── index.js                        # Unified dispatcher\n├── TOOLS-OSINT.md                  # Full documentation\n├── README.md                       # Quick start\n├── test-data-*.csv/json            # Sample datasets\n└── skills/\n    ├── osint-crawl/               # Web crawler\n    ├── osint-analyze/             # Data analyzer\n    ├── osint-youtube/             # YouTube extractor\n    └── osint-search-multi/        # Multi-search\n```\n\n## Support\n- Full docs: `TOOLS-OSINT.md`\n- Skill docs: `skills/[skill]/SKILL.md`\n- Issues: Report with command, error, and sample data\n\n---\n\n**Version**: 1.0.0\n**Last Updated**: 2024-02-18\n**License**: MIT","file_path":"D:\\workspace\\appDev\\openclaw\\workspace-osint\\QUICKREF.txt"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"stepfun/step-3.5-flash:free","usage":{"input":43461,"output":1335,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":44796,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771419860087}}
